 ## Delivery format
 
-- Front matter totals 445 min (325 teaching + 120 exercises); `instructors/instructor-notes.md` still describes a two-day plan. Actual deliveries are one in-person day, about 5.5 h of instruction (9:00 to 16:05 with two breaks and lunch), so every episode is taught condensed and the exercises are mostly handed to self-paced follow-up. The schedule in `learners/setup.md` is the source of truth for the live plan; the current condensation is recorded in updates.md.
